7. Commercial Licensing

Commercial use of GhostHunter requires prior written permission from the GhostHunter Development Team.

Commercial use includes, but is not limited to:

* Selling the game.
* Selling modified versions.
* Charging money for downloads.
* Including GhostHunter in paid software.
* Monetizing gameplay based on modified distributions of the project.
